Exactly one of these twelve is the original domain. Some of the others are domains this tool
rewrites *into*, so they are deliberately tempting.

1. Aircraft airworthiness tracking — Component life limits, maintenance intervals, and airworthiness directive compliance.
2. Textile mill production — Loom scheduling, yarn lot tracking, and shift production reporting in a weaving mill.
3. Recipe management — Recipes, ingredients, and meal planning for a cooking application.
4. Library catalog and circulation — Bibliographic holdings, branch lending, reservations, and returns for a public library system.
5. Hotel reservations — Room inventory, availability search, and guest reservations for a hotel chain.
6. Event scheduling — Venues, sessions, and attendee registration for a conference scheduling system.
7. Municipal water metering — Service points, meter reads, and consumption billing for a municipal water utility.
8. Wildlife tracking — Tagged animal sightings, collar telemetry, and habitat surveys for a field research program.
9. Amateur radio contact logging — Logging two-way radio contacts, confirmations, and award tracking for amateur radio operators.
10. Seismic event monitoring — Seismograph station networks, waveform ingest, and earthquake event cataloging.
11. Music streaming — Track catalogs, playlists, and listener session handling for a streaming service.
12. Freight dispatch — Shipment routing, carrier assignment, and delivery tracking for a freight operation.

